Package: sysinfo
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, iproute2
Description: concise local Linux system information summary
 sysinfo displays load, disk, memory and swap use, process and SSH connection
 counts, network addresses, and uptime. It is a small independent POSIX shell
 implementation suitable for interactive use or login messages.
